  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=768, score=1.50500595\n=== Phase 1: Initialization ===\n  Top 3 inits: [('parent', '1.505006'), ('gauss_wide', '2.092642'), ('parent_n0', '2.435353')]\n  Phase 1 time: 0.0s\n\n=== Phase 2: LP-FW Main (n=768) ===\n  Time allocation: 698s\n    LPFW iter 30: obj=0.000979821475, alpha=0.0062, gap=1.12e-04, t=374s/698s\n  NEW BEST [lpfw_main]: 1.50500576 (n=768)\n  Phase 2 time: 901.4s\n\n=== Phase 3: LP-FW M-Reduction ===\n  Time allocation: 187s\n  Phase 3 time: 291.6s\n\n=== Phase 4: Multi-Length Exploration ===\n  Phase 4 time: 333.9s\n\n=== Phase 5: Diverse Restarts ===\n  NEW BEST [restart_3]: 1.50500575 (n=768)\n  Phase 5 time: 159.5s\n\n=== Phase 6: Final Polish ===\n  NEW BEST [coord_polish]: 1.50500568 (n=768)\n  NEW BEST [final_squeeze]: 1.50500566 (n=768)\n  Phase 6 time: 32.8s\n\nFINAL SCORE: 1.50500566 (n=768)",
